  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining CSS Architecture**\n\nI\'m currently structuring the CSS architecture for this project. I\'ve integrated Tailwind v4 using `@import \"tailwindcss\";`. My focus now is on defining style variables, custom scrollbars, and helper classes within `src/index.css`. I\'m also ensuring that font families like `font-serif` will utilize a custom font, like \'Cinzel\', and that the default sans-serif font is \'Plus Jakarta Sans\'.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_121405"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  body {\\n    font-family: \'Plus Jakarta Sans\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, sans-serif;\\n  }\\n\\n  h1, h2, .font-legal-heading {\\n    font-family: \'Cinzel\', serif, Georgia;\\n  }\\n\\n  code, .font-mono-legal {\\n    font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom scrollbar for legal document & tables */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.4);\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.6);\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Configurar estilos base de tipograf\303\255a y barras de desplazamiento jur\303\255dicas en index.css\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Actualizando estilos globales\",\"toolSummary\":\"Configurar index.css\"}"
