  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Models**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the data models for BDCM Abogados. Specifically, I\'m working on the `Client` model. It will include fields such as `id`, `rut`, `name`, `clientType` (with the options \'PERSONA_NATURAL\' or \'PERSONA_JURIDICA\'), `email`, `phone`, `address`, and `commune`. This is where I\'ll start building the core data structure.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Structure**\n\nNow I\'m diving deeper into the `Case` data model. I\'ve added fields like `rol`, `court`, and `subject`, carefully considering the court types and subject matter. I\'m also including `clientRole`, `opposingParty`, `status`, and monetary fields such as `amountType` and `amountValue`. I\'ve added `pjudLink` to allow linking to the online case information. I\'m also thinking of how to handle the `CaseEvent[]` for the case stages, and the deadline entity for `CaseDeadline`.\n\n\n**Adding Meeting Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on specific event details. I\'m building out `CaseDeadline` to include status options like \'CUMPLIDO\' or \'VENCIDO,\' priority levels (\'ALTA,\' \'MEDIA,\' \'BAJA\'), an `alertDaysBefore` field, notes, and calendar syncing. Additionally, I\'m working on the `Hearing` entity, including types, modalities, locations, attendees, and statuses, with calendar integration in mind. I\'m also adding related data to the fee and installment modules.\n\n\n**Integrating Calendar Functionality**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the Google Calendar integration. I\'ve successfully initialized the setup with Firebase and GoogleAuthProvider, handling authentication and scoping for calendar events. My focus is on robust functionality, including creating, updating, and deleting events within Google Calendar. The synchronization logic for deadlines and hearings is well underway. I\'m also planning quick external links for alternative external access. Furthermore, I\'ve added functions to the calendar to provide an export option to .ics files, and open the calendar event directly on Google Calendar\'s web interface.\n\n\n**Adding Chilean Legal Context**\n\nI\'m now incorporating specific Chilean legal features. I\'ve integrated a Chilean RUT validator and formatter, and a list of Chilean courts. Furthermore, I\'ve implemented a legal deadlines calculator accounting for both judicial and continuous days, along with a pre-loaded list of Chilean holidays. I\'m also preparing currency formatters for CLP and UF. I am working on adding example seed data.\n\n\n**Implementing Case Data**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on populating the database with realistic examples. I\'m adding actual case data, including RIT and RUC numbers, court details, and relevant legal contexts. I\'m designing client information with valid Chilean RUTs and different fee arrangements, covering payment statuses and upcoming deadlines. The test data also includes Zoom PJUD links and court room locations for hearings, alongside the implementation of the notification system in `src/services/notifications.ts`.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Views**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the user interface design. I\'m visualizing the \"Escritorio BDCM\" dashboard with a welcome banner and key performance indicators (KPIs) like active cases and upcoming deadlines. The dashboard will feature an interactive calendar and a clear presentation of deadlines and upcoming hearings. I\'m also planning quick filters for the case module to enable efficient information access.\n\n\n**Visualizing Feature Implementation**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the key features from the design. I\'m focusing on the **Clients** module for enhanced contact management with options to call or email directly from the platform. I am also working on linked case files and a concise summary of each client\'s payment status, with a real-time Chilean RUT validator for new client registrations. I\'m moving on to implement the **Procedural Deadlines** and **Hearings** module.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_153255"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type ClientType = \'PERSONA_NATURAL\' | \'PERSONA_JURIDICA\';\\n\\nexport interface Client {\\n  id: string;\\n  rut: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  clientType: ClientType;\\n  email: string;\\n  phone: string;\\n  address: string;\\n  commune: string;\\n  region: string;\\n  representativeName?: string;\\n  representativeRut?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type CourtType =\\n  | \'CIVIL\'\\n  | \'LABORAL\'\\n  | \'FAMILIA\'\\n  | \'GARANTIA\'\\n  | \'TOP\'\\n  | \'CORTE_APELACIONES\'\\n  | \'CORTE_SUPREMA\'\\n  | \'POLICIA_LOCAL\'\\n  | \'ARBITRAL\';\\n\\nexport type LegalSubject =\\n  | \'Civil\'\\n  | \'Laboral\'\\n  | \'Familia\'\\n  | \'Penal\'\\n  | \'Comercial\'\\n  | \'Inmobiliario\'\\n  | \'Polic\303\255a Local\'\\n  | \'Constitucional\'\\n  | \'Cobranza Judicial\'\\n  | \'Corporativo\';\\n\\nexport type ClientRole =\\n  | \'DEMANDANTE\'\\n  | \'DEMANDADO\'\\n  | \'QUERELLANTE\'\\n  | \'IMPUTADO\'\\n  | \'RECURRENTE\'\\n  | \'RECURRIDO\'\\n  | \'SOLICITANTE\'\\n  | \'TERCERO\';\\n\\nexport type CaseStatus =\\n  | \'TRAMITACION\'\\n  | \'CITACION_SENTENCIA\'\\n  | \'EN_ACUERDO\'\\n  | \'SUSPENDIDA\'\\n  | \'APELACION\'\\n  | \'ARCHIVADA\'\\n  | \'TERMINADA\';\\n\\nexport interface CaseEvent {\\n  id: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  actor: string; // ej: \\\"Tribunal\\\", \\\"Abogado BDCM\\\", \\\"Contraparte\\\"\\n  documentName?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LegalCase {\\n  id: string;\\n  rol: string; // ej: C-1240-2024 o O-450-2024\\n  caratula: string; // ej: \\\"P\303\251rez con Inversiones Norte SpA\\\"\\n  court: string; // ej: \\\"14\302\260 Juzgado Civil de Santiago\\\"\\n  courtType: CourtType;\\n  subject: LegalSubject;\\n  clientId: string;\\n  clientRole: ClientRole;\\n  opposingParty: string;\\n  opposingLawyer?: string;\\n  status: CaseStatus;\\n  assignedLawyer: string; // Abogado responsable\\n  currency: \'CLP\' | \'UF\';\\n  amount?: number;\\n  pjudLink?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  timeline: CaseEvent[];\\n}\\n\\nexport type DeadlineDaysType = \'HABILES_CIVIL\' | \'HABILES_LABORAL\' | \'CORRIDOS\';\\n\\nexport interface CaseDeadline {\\n  id: string;\\n  caseId: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  deadlineDate: string; // YYYY-MM-DD\\n  deadlineTime: string; // HH:mm (ej: 23:59 o 12:00)\\n  isFatal: boolean; // Plazo fatal legal chileno\\n  daysType: DeadlineDaysType;\\n  daysCount?: number;\\n  status: \'PENDIENTE\' | \'CUMPLIDO\' | \'VENCIDO\';\\n  priority: \'ALTA\' | \'MEDIA\' | \'BAJA\';\\n  alertDaysBefore: number;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  syncedToCalendar?: boolean;\\n  googleEventId?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type HearingType =\\n  | \'PREPARATORIA\'\\n  | \'JUICIO_ORAL\'\\n  | \'CONCILIACION\'\\n  | \'MEDIDAS_CAUTELARES\'\\n  | \'ALEGATOS\'\\n  | \'REUNION_CLIENTE\'\\n  | \'DECLARACION\'\\n  | \'OTRA\';\\n\\nexport interface Hearing {\\n  id: string;\\n  caseId?: string; // Puede ser de una causa o una reuni\303\263n general de despacho\\n  title: string;\\n  type: HearingType;\\n  date: string; // YYYY-MM-DD\\n  startTime: string; // HH:mm\\n  endTime: string; // HH:mm\\n  modality: \'PRESENCIAL\' | \'TELEMATICA_ZOOM\' | \'GOOGLE_MEET\' | \'OTRA\';\\n  courtRoomOrLink: string;\\n  attendees: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  status: \'PROGRAMADA\' | \'REALIZADA\' | \'SUSPENDIDA\' | \'CANCELADA\';\\n  syncedToCalendar?: boolean;\\n  googleEventId?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport type FeeType = \'FIJO\' | \'CUOTA_LITIS\' | \'MIXTO\' | \'MENSUAL\';\\n\\nexport interface FeeAgreement {\\n  id: string;\\n  caseId: string;\\n  clientId: string;\\n  feeType: FeeType;\\n  currency: \'CLP\' | \'UF\';\\n  totalAmount: number;\\n  installmentsCount: number;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FeeInstallment {\\n  id: string;\\n  feeAgreementId: string;\\n  caseId: string;\\n  clientId: string;\\n  installmentNumber: number;\\n  totalInstallments: number;\\n  dueDate: string; // YYYY-MM-DD\\n  amount: number;\\n  currency: \'CLP\' | \'UF\';\\n  status: \'PENDIENTE\' | \'PAGADA\' | \'ATRASADA\';\\n  paidDate?: string;\\n  paymentMethod?: \'TRANSFERENCIA\' | \'VALE_VISTA\' | \'CHEQUE\' | \'WEBPAY\' | \'EFECTIVO\';\\n  receiptFolio?: string; // Folio Boleta o Factura\\n  notes?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LawyerUser {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  role: string;\\n  rut?: string;\\n  avatarColor?: string;\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Definici\303\263n de modelos de datos TypeScript para BDCM Abogados\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creando modelos de datos TypeScript\",\"toolSummary\":\"Crear tipos de datos TypeScript\"}"
