  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Initial Dataset**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the seed dataset in `/src/data/initialData.ts`. It\'s crucial this reflects a real Chilean law firm, \"BDCM Abogados\". I\'m populating it with lawyers like Enrique Blanco, the Socio Director, with his specializations, along with Rodrigo Donoso. This is the first step towards a realistic simulation.\n\n\n**Adding Client Details**\n\nI\'ve expanded the seed data. I\'ve integrated details for lawyers Carolina Morales and her specializations into the `/src/data/initialData.ts` file, along with several realistic clients and their associated RUT numbers. My focus now is incorporating example legal cases, including their ROL, RIT, and RUC numbers, court, and subject matter to better simulate a Chilean legal scenario. I\'m focusing on defining the structure of these \'causas\' for inclusion.\n\n\n**Defining Legal Case Details**\n\nI\'m now incorporating specific legal cases into `/src/data/initialData.ts`. I\'m including cases such as \"Ministerio P\303\272blico c/ Silva\" at the 7\302\260 Juzgado de Garant\303\255a de Santiago, with associated ROL, RIT, and subject matter details. I\'m also adding \"Mu\303\261oz c/ Valenzuela\" at the Juzgado de Familia de San Miguel, and \"Distribuidora Austral c/ Seremi de Salud RM\" at the Iltma. Corte de Apelaciones de Santiago, with their corresponding data. I\'m also focusing on adding a set of example deadlines and hearings.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_168985"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Client, LegalCase, CaseDeadline, Hearing, FeeAgreement, FeeInstallment, LawyerUser } from \'../types\';\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_LAWYERS: LawyerUser[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'lawyer-1\',\\n    name: \'Enrique Blanco Zambrano\',\\n    email: \'enriqueblanco.abogado@gmail.com\',\\n    role: \'Socio Director - Litigios & Corporativo\',\\n    rut: \'15.420.198-3\',\\n    avatarColor: \'bg-amber-600\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'lawyer-2\',\\n    name: \'Rodrigo Donoso Castro\',\\n    email: \'r.donoso@bdcm.cl\',\\n    role: \'Socio - Laboral y Familia\',\\n    rut: \'16.712.345-K\',\\n    avatarColor: \'bg-blue-600\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'lawyer-3\',\\n    name: \'Carolina Morales Vidal\',\\n    email: \'c.morales@bdcm.cl\',\\n    role: \'Abogada Asociada - Civil & Cobranzas\',\\n    rut: \'18.190.231-4\',\\n    avatarColor: \'bg-emerald-600\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_CLIENTS: Client[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'cli-1\',\\n    rut: \'76.892.410-K\',\\n    name: \'Inversiones del Sur SpA\',\\n    clientType: \'PERSONA_JURIDICA\',\\n    email: \'contacto@inversionesdelsur.cl\',\\n    phone: \'+56 9 8412 9043\',\\n    address: \'Av. Apoquindo 4700, Of. 802\',\\n    commune: \'Las Condes\',\\n    region: \'Regi\303\263n Metropolitana\',\\n    representativeName: \'Fernando Vald\303\251s Echenique\',\\n    representativeRut: \'11.458.923-1\',\\n    notes: \'Cliente corporativo clave. Facturaci\303\263n con orden de compra exenta de IVA.\',\\n    createdAt: \'2024-01-15\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'cli-2\',\\n    rut: \'14.382.915-2\',\\n    name: \'Manuel Antonio Pavez Contreras\',\\n    clientType: \'PERSONA_NATURAL\',\\n    email: \'manuel.pavez.c@gmail.com\',\\n    phone: \'+56 9 7291 8832\',\\n    address: \'Calle Los Jazmines 1450\',\\n    commune: \'\303\221u\303\261oa\',\\n    region: \'Regi\303\263n Metropolitana\',\\n    notes: \'Ex-gerente de operaciones demandante en causa laboral contra retail.\',\\n    