  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining UI Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the UI components, starting with `Navbar.tsx`. I\'ve outlined the branding elements: the firm\'s name, logo, and tagline. Next, I\'ll dive into the specific design considerations for both mobile and desktop experiences, aiming for top-tier aesthetics and intuitive UX.\n\n\n**Outlining Feature Sets**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on feature outlines, specifically for `Navbar.tsx` and `Sidebar.tsx`. The Navbar will feature a global search, Google Calendar connection status, audio toggles, and a quick \"New\" button. The Sidebar will provide tab navigation for key areas like dashboard, cases, clients, deadlines, hearings, fees, and PJUD tools. I\'m also planning the `DashboardView.tsx`, aiming for summary cards and an urgent deadlines banner.\n\n\n**Structuring Dashboard Elements**\n\nI\'m now structuring the dashboard. I plan a split layout: on the left, an agenda of upcoming hearings and meetings plus a quick connect button for Zoom/Meet. The right side will display recent legal movements and overdue/due installments. I\'ll include quick links to the Virtual Judicial Office, Case Inquiries, and Judicial Holidays. My goal is to maximize user access to information and minimize clicks.\n\n\n**Defining Client Actions**\n\nI\'m now outlining client-specific actions. I\'m focusing on direct actions: WhatsApp click-to-chat, direct calls, and adding new case files. I\'m also planning a modal for adding and editing clients, including a dynamic Chilean RUT validator.\n\n**Visualizing Deadline Management**\n\nI\'ve transitioned to deadline visualization. I\'m designing a visual deadline manager with color-coded categories: overdue (red), due today (pulsating amber), next 1-3 days (yellow), next 7 days (blue), and completed/archived (gray). I\'m planning individual and bulk Google Calendar sync options, .ICS export, and direct links to Google Calendar. A new deadline modal will have a calculation assistant for legal frameworks.\n\n**Organizing Hearing Information**\n\nFinally, I am focused on organizing hearing information in a list and calendar view for judicial hearings and client meetings. I\'ll support various modalities: PJUD Zoom, Google Meet, and in-person meetings with courtroom details. Actions include Google Calendar sync and direct video call access.\n\n\n**Developing Fee Dashboards**\n\nI\'m now diving into the financial dashboard for fees. I\'m focusing on key data points like agreed-upon, collected, outstanding, and overdue amounts. I\'m also implementing filters for various payment statuses and a \"Register Payment\" button, with a modal for inputting payment details and the relevant invoice information. Furthermore, I\'m working on a \"New Fee Agreement\" modal for different agreement types. I\'m also planning a formal receipt generator. I\'m moving on to building a Chilean legal deadline calculator.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_268587"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { useLegal } from \'../../context/LegalContext\';\\nimport { CourtType, LegalSubject, ClientRole, CaseStatus } from \'../../types\';\\nimport { CHILEAN_COURTS } from \'../../utils/chileanLegal\';\\nimport { X, Scale, FileText, UserCheck, Building2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface Props {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  preselectedClientId?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const NewCaseModal: React.FC<Props> = ({ isOpen, onClose, preselectedClientId }) => {\\n  const { clients, lawyers, addCase } = useLegal();\\n\\n  const [rol, setRol] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [caratula, setCaratula] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [court, setCourt] = useState(CHILEAN_COURTS[0]);\\n  const [courtType, setCourtType] = useState<CourtType>(\'CIVIL\');\\n  const [subject, setSubject] = useState<LegalSubject>(\'Civil\');\\n  const [clientId, setClientId] = useState(preselectedClientId || (clients[0]?.id || \'\'));\\n  const [clientRole, setClientRole] = useState<ClientRole>(\'DEMANDANTE\');\\n  const [opposingParty, setOpposingParty] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [opposingLawyer, setOpposingLawyer] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [status, setStatus] = useState<CaseStatus>(\'TRAMITACION\');\\n  const [assignedLawyer, setAssignedLawyer] = useState(lawyers[0]?.name || \'Enrique Blanco Zambrano\');\\n  const [currency, setCurrency] = useState<\'CLP\' | \'UF\'>(\'CLP\');\\n  const [amount, setAmount] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const [pjudLink, setPjudLink] = useState(\'https://ojv.pjud.cl/kpitec-ojv-web/login\');\\n  const [notes, setNotes] = useState(\'\');\\n\\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\\n\\n  const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!rol.trim() || !caratula.trim() || !clientId) {\\n      alert(\'Por favor completa el ROL, car\303\241tula y selecciona el cliente.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    addCase({\\n      rol: rol.trim(),\\n      caratula: caratula.trim(),\\n      court,\\n      courtType,\\n      subject,\\n      clientId,\\n      clientRole,\\n      opposingParty: opposingParty.trim() || \'No informada\',\\n      opposingLawyer: opposingLawyer.trim(),\\n      status,\\n      assignedLawyer,\\n      currency,\\n      amount: amount ? Number(amount) : undefined,\\n      pjudLink,\\n      notes: notes.trim(),\\n    });\\n\\n    onClose();\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl w-full max-w-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden my-8 animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400\\\">\\n              <Scale className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 font-legal-heading\\\">Nueva Causa Judicial</h2>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Apertura de expediente en BDCM Abogados</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onClose}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"p-6 space-y-4 max-h-[75vh] overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                ROL / RIT / RUC <span className=\\\"text-amber-400\\\">*</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={rol}\\n                onChange={(e) => setRol(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Ej: C-4521-2024 o O-812-2024\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400 font-mono-legal\\\"\\n                required\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Materia Judicial <span className=\\\"text-amber-400\\\">*</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                value={subject}\\n                onChange={(e) => setSubject(e.target.value as LegalSubject)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                <option value=\\\"Civil\\\">Civil</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Laboral\\\">Laboral</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Familia\\\">Familia</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Penal\\\">Penal</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Comercial\\\">Comercial</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Inmobiliario\\\">Inmobiliario</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Polic\303\255a Local\\\">Polic\303\255a Local</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Constitucional\\\">Constitucional</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Cobranza Judicial\\\">Cobranza Judicial</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Corporativo\\\">Corporativo</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n              Car\303\241tula de la Causa <span className=\\\"text-amber-400\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <input\\n              type=\\\"text\\\"\\n              value={caratula}\\n              onChange={(e) => setCaratula(e.target.value)}\\n              placeholder=\\\"Ej: Demandante con Demandado SpA\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400 font-medium\\\"\\n              required\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Tribunal o Corte de Radicaci\303\263n <span className=\\\"text-amber-400\\\">*</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                list=\\\"court-list\\\"\\n                value={court}\\n                onChange={(e) => setCourt(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Ej: 14\302\260 Juzgado Civil de Santiago\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n                required\\n              />\\n              <datalist id=\\\"court-list\\\">\\n                {CHILEAN_COURTS.map((c) => (\\n                  <option key={c} value={c} />\\n                ))}\\n              </datalist>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Tipo de Tribunal\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                value={courtType}\\n                onChange={(e) => setCourtType(e.target.value as CourtType)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                <option value=\\\"CIVIL\\\">Juzgado Civil / Letras</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"LABORAL\\\">Juzgado del Trabajo</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"FAMILIA\\\">Juzgado de Familia</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"GARANTIA\\\">Juzgado de Garant\303\255a</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"TOP\\\">Tribunal Oral en lo Penal</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"CORTE_APELACIONES\\\">Corte de Apelaciones</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"CORTE_SUPREMA\\\">Corte Suprema</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"POLICIA_LOCAL\\\">Polic\303\255a Local</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"ARBITRAL\\\">Tribunal Arbitral</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Cliente Patrocinado <span className=\\\"text-amber-400\\\">*</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                value={clientId}\\n                onChange={(e) => setClientId(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n                required\\n              >\\n                {clients.map((cli) => (\\n                  <option key={cli.id} value={cli.id}>\\n                    {cli.name} ({cli.rut})\\n                  </option>\\n                ))}\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Calidad de Nuestro Cliente\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                value={clientRole}\\n                onChange={(e) => setClientRole(e.target.value as ClientRole)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                <option value=\\\"DEMANDANTE\\\">Demandante / Actor</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"DEMANDADO\\\">Demandado</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"QUERELLANTE\\\">Querellante / V\303\255ctima</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"IMPUTADO\\\">Imputado / Defensa</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"RECURRENTE\\\">Recurrente</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"RECURRIDO\\\">Recurrido</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"SOLICITANTE\\\">Solicitante (No contencioso)</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"TERCERO\\\">Tercero coadyuvante / excluyente</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Contraparte\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={opposingParty}\\n                onChange={(e) => setOpposingParty(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Nombre o empresa de la contraparte\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Abogado de Contraparte\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={opposingLawyer}\\n                onChange={(e) => setOpposingLawyer(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Nombre del colega / estudio contrario\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Abogado a Cargo (BDCM)\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                value={assignedLawyer}\\n                onChange={(e) => setAssignedLawyer(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                {lawyers.map((l) => (\\n                  <option key={l.id} value={l.name}>\\n                    {l.name}\\n                  </option>\\n                ))}\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Estado Procesal\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                value={status}\\n                onChange={(e) => setStatus(e.target.value as CaseStatus)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                <option value=\\\"TRAMITACION\\\">En Tramitaci\303\263n</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"CITACION_SENTENCIA\\\">Citaci\303\263n a O\303\255r Sentencia</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"EN_ACUERDO\\\">En Acuerdo</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"SUSPENDIDA\\\">Suspendida</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"APELACION\\\">En Apelaci\303\263n / Corte</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"TERMINADA\\\">Terminada / Fallada</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"ARCHIVADA\\\">Archivada</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Cuant\303\255a Estimada\\n              </label>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n                <select\\n                  value={currency}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setCurrency(e.target.value as \'CLP\' | \'UF\')}\\n                  className=\\\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 text-xs text-slate-200\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <option value=\\\"CLP\\\">CLP ($)</option>\\n                  <option value=\\\"UF\\\">UF</option>\\n                </select>\\n                <input\\n                  type=\\\"number\\\"\\n                  value={amount}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setAmount(e.target.value)}\\n                  placeholder=\\\"Monto\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n              Enlace Oficina Judicial Virtual (PJUD)\\n            </label>\\n            <input\\n              type=\\\"url\\\"\\n              value={pjudLink}\\n              onChange={(e) => setPjudLink(e.target.value)}\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400 text-blue-400 font-mono-legal\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n              Notas y Estrategia Procesal\\n            </label>\\n            <textarea\\n              rows={3}\\n              value={notes}\\n              onChange={(e) => setNotes(e.target.value)}\\n              placeholder=\\\"Detalles clave, antecedentes probatorios o consideraciones estrat\303\251gicas del estudio...\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-amber-400 resize-none\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-end gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onClose}\\n              className=\\\"px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              Cancelar\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n              className=\\\"px-5 py-2 bg-linear-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-semibold text-sm rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <FileText className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              Crear Expediente\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Modal para la creaci\303\263n de causas judiciales en BDCM Abogados con autocompletado de tribunales chilenos\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/modals/NewCaseModal.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creando NewCaseModal\",\"toolSummary\":\"Crear NewCaseModal.tsx\"}"
