  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming PWA Assets**\n\nI\'ve verified the presence of all necessary PWA icon assets. Now, I\'m integrating `VitePWA` into `vite.config.ts`, following the PWA skill\'s guidance.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_307091"
      name: "write_to_file"
