  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - User request: Create a legal practice management app for \"BDCM ABOGADOS\" located in Chile (clientes, causas, honorarios, audiencias, plazos, cuotas, Google Calendar sync, notificaciones de vencimientos).\n   - In subsequent turns: User requested to test on phone, but then explicitly requested: \"el boton de + para agregar cosas nuevas debe estar en la pantalla principal y en la superior. Lo de agregar apk mobil eliminar, y dejar agregar + y calculadora\" (Remove APK mobile download, keep \'+\' button prominently on both the superior navbar and the main dashboard screen, and keep the CPC legal calculator).\n   - Trigger for current turn: Fix Vite runtime build errors caused by missing files:\n     * `Failed to resolve import \"./index.css\" from \"src/main.tsx\"`\n     * `Failed to resolve import \"./context/LegalContext\" from \"src/App.tsx\"`\n     * `Failed to resolve import \"../context/LegalContext\" from \"src/components/Navbar.tsx\"`\n     * `Failed to resolve import \"../../context/LegalContext\" from \"src/components/views/DashboardView.tsx\"`\n     * `Failed to resolve import \"../../context/LegalContext\" from \"src/components/views/ToolsView.tsx\"`\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - Restored files in this turn:\n     * `/src/index.css`: Recreated with Tailwind v4 base styles, custom scrollbars, and Cinzel/Plus Jakarta Sans/JetBrains Mono font settings.\n     * `/src/types/index.ts`: Recreated with all TypeScript interfaces (`Client`, `LegalCase`, `CaseDeadline`, `Hearing`, `FeeAgreement`, `FeeInstallment`, `LawyerUser`, etc.).\n     * `/src/utils/chileanLegal.ts`: Recreated with Chilean RUT validator/formatter (M\303\263dulo 11), Chilean courts list, Chilean holidays, CPC Art. 66 legal deadline calculator, currency formatters (`CLP`, `UF`), and Google Calendar / ICS export builders.\n     * `/src/data/initialData.ts`: Recreated with realistic initial seed data for BDCM Abogados in Chile (cases, clients, deadlines, hearings, fee agreements, installments).\n     * `/src/services/auth.ts`: Recreated with Firebase Google Auth and token cache.\n   - Files that existed before this turn:\n     * `/src/App.tsx`: Contains routing and layout with `Navbar`, `Sidebar`, views, and modals.\n     * `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`: Contains \"+ Nuevo\" dropdown, \"Calculadora\" button, notifications, and Google Calendar auth.\n     * `/src/components/views/DashboardView.tsx`: Main dashboard with \"+ Agregar Nuevo\" hero button, quick-action cards, and FAB \"+\".\n     * `/src/components/views/ToolsView.tsx`: Chilean deadline calculator, PJUD links, and JSON backup tools.\n     * `/src/main.tsx`: App root entry.\n     * `/firebase-applet-config.json`: Provisioned Google/Firebase config.\n     * `/public/`: Contains `icon.svg`, `pwa-192x192.png`, `pwa-512x512.png`, `apple-touch-icon.png`, `favicon.ico`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - Several subdirectories and components in `/src/` were wiped during manual file recreation in the user\'s previous turn.\n   - We must restore the remaining missing files before compiling:\n     * `/src/services/googleCalendar.ts`\n     * `/src/services/notifications.ts`\n     * `/src/context/LegalContext.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/views/CasesView.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/views/ClientsView.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/views/DeadlinesView.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/views/HearingsView.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/views/FeesView.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/NewCaseModal.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/NewClientModal.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/NewDeadlineModal.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/NewHearingModal.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/NewFeeAgreementModal.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/RegisterPaymentModal.tsx`\n     * `/src/components/modals/ReceiptModal.tsx`\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - `Internal server error: Failed to resolve import \"./index.css\" from \"src/main.tsx\"`: Fixed by recreating `/src/index.css`.\n   - `Pre-transform error: Failed to resolve import \"./context/LegalContext\" from \"src/App.tsx\"`: In progress, need to create `/src/context/LegalContext.tsx` and its supporting services.\n   - Similar errors for `CasesView.tsx`, `ClientsView.tsx`, `DeadlinesView.tsx`, `HearingsView.tsx`, `FeesView.tsx`, and the modals referenced in `App.tsx`: Must be written to disk.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Runtime: Vite 8.3 + React 19 + Tailwind v4 + Express.\n   - Dev server runs on port 3000.\n   - Dependencies installed: `firebase`, `vite-plugin-pwa`, `sharp`, `motion`, `lucide-react`, `express`.\n\n6. **Next Steps (Priority Order)**\n   1. Write `/src/services/googleCalendar.ts`: Google Calendar API helper (`createGoogleCalendarEvent`, `deleteGoogleCalendarEvent`).\n   2. Write `/src/services/notifications.ts`: Web Audio API acoustic chime/alert and browser notification trigger.\n   3. Write `/src/context/LegalContext.tsx`: Full context with CRUD, state management, local storage persistence, and Google Calendar sync.\n   4. Write `/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`: Navigation sidebar with counters.\n   5. Write `/src/components/views/CasesView.tsx`: Case management view with timeline and filters.\n   6. Write `/src/components/views/ClientsView.tsx`: Client management view with RUT and contact shortcuts.\n   7. Write `/src/components/views/DeadlinesView.tsx`: Fatal deadlines view with filters and calendar sync.\n   8. Write `/src/components/views/HearingsView.tsx`: Hearings and court appearances with Zoom PJUD links.\n   9. Write `/src/components/views/FeesView.tsx`: Fees, installments, and receipts tracking.\n   10. Write modals in `/src/components/modals/`:\n       - `NewCaseModal.tsx`\n       - `NewClientModal.tsx`\n       - `NewDeadlineModal.tsx`\n       - `NewHearingModal.tsx`\n       - `NewFeeAgreementModal.tsx`\n       - `RegisterPaymentModal.tsx`\n       - `ReceiptModal.tsx`\n   11. Execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel to verify zero errors.\n   12. Restart the dev server (`restart_dev_server`).\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Despacho name: \"BDCM ABOGADOS\", Chile.\n   - Keep the \"+\" button prominently on both the superior bar (Navbar) and main screen (Dashboard), and keep the CPC legal calculator.\n   - Do NOT re-add APK mobile download buttons or modals.\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` before completing.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 262
    render_latest_checkpoint: true
    total_subagent_count: 0
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^6.1.1\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nvite: ^8.3.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@types/react: ^19.3.0\n@types/react-dom: ^19.3.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.3.3\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ^7.0.2\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"My Google AI Studio App\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n/**\n * @license\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n */\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return <div></div>;\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"],\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"dist\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\342\200\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
    }
